# The working corpus is derived data: re-runnable from the source, and large.
# The *evaluation* corpus is different — it is committed as
# tests/fixtures/corpus.jsonl so the published eval numbers reproduce from a
# clean clone. Results you cannot reproduce are not results.
data/
!data/.gitkeep

# Eval reports are regenerated by `make eval`; only the committed golden set
# and the ablation write-up belong in git.
eval/report-*.json
eval/ci-report.json
!data/dof.sqlite3
